  "toxicity_level": "Low",
  "violation_category": "Harassment",
  "suggested_action": "Flag",
  "reasoning": "The post is mildly rude and dismissive, targeting another user without direct threats or severe abuse. Flagged as a minor etiquette violation."
}

SUCCESS CRITERIA:
Your output must always be well-structured, valid JSON, with all fields present and no extra text.
If the post is ambiguous or contains mixed content, explain the uncertainty in "reasoning" and default to "Review" if unsure.
Aim for 90%+ accuracy in both toxicity and category assignment, and always recommend the correct action.
